+��合成说明Composition description
����1.两只宠物合成后，会随机消失一只,没有主副之分。
2.合成后的宠物属性来源是放置宠物的属性取其最大值和最小值中的随机值，取完后再进行上下浮动。
3.合成后的技能来源是放置宠物的技能，每个技能有一定概率的留存或删除
4.宠物有天生技能，当你把宠物的天生技能使用其他技能书替换时，再进行合成其天生技能还会再次出现的哦。�1. After two pets are combined, one will disappear randomly, and there is no distinction between primary and secondary pets. 
2. The source of the synthesized pet attribute is the random value of the maximum value and the minimum value of the attribute of the placed pet, and then float up and down after the random value is taken. 
3. The source of the synthesized skill is the skill that places the pet, and each skill has a certain probability of retention or deletion 
4.Pets have natural skills, when you use other skill books to replace the pet's natural skills, and then synthesize its natural skills will appear again.
