����1.活动开启后,所有12级以上玩家均可进入。
 2.活动开启10分钟后将禁止所有玩家进入此地图。
 3.在角斗场内,玩家将互相发起挑战,坚持到最后1名的玩家将会
 获得丰厚奖励。
 4.在同一个角斗场内,人数最多达到20人。
 5.20:00活动结束,如果场内剩余多人,则按照当前最低排名发放奖励。�1. After the opening of the activity, all players above level 12 can enter. 
 2. All players will be banned from entering this map 10 minutes after the event opens. 
 3. In the arena, players will challenge each other, and the last player will be 
 rewarded. 
 4. The maximum number of people in the same arena is 20. 
 5.At the end of the activity at 20:00, if there are more people left in the venue, the reward will be given according to the current lowest ranking.
